<%@ page pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-5"><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Matching Criteria</h1><p>Criteria support review; staff retain authority over selections. Skills and interests match exact text, ignoring case.</p><label>Application cycle<select id="criteriaPeriod" class="input"></select></label><label>Position<select id="criteriaJob" class="input"></select></label><p id="criteriaMessage" role="status"></p><form id="criteriaForm" class="card p-5 space-y-4"><fieldset id="criteriaFields" class="space-y-4">
<label class="block">Required skills (one per line)<textarea name="requiredSkills" class="input" rows="4"></textarea></label><label class="block">Preferred skills (one per line)<textarea name="preferredSkills" class="input" rows="4"></textarea></label><label class="block">Preferred course / subject interests (one per line)<textarea name="subjectInterests" class="input" rows="3"></textarea></label><label class="block">Eligible student levels (one per line: undergraduate, masters, phd; blank allows all)<textarea name="studentLevels" class="input" rows="3"></textarea></label><label class="flex gap-2"><input type="checkbox" name="trainingRequired">Completed training required</label><label class="flex gap-2"><input type="checkbox" name="teachingExperiencePreferred">Teaching experience preferred</label><label class="block">Skill options offered to students (one per line; required and preferred skills are included automatically)<textarea name="skillOptions" class="input" rows="4"></textarea></label><label class="flex gap-2"><input type="checkbox" name="sexualHarassmentTrainingRequired">Online Sexual Harassment Training required</label><button class="btn btn-primary">Save criteria</button></fieldset></form></div>
